# Tauri Python sidecar bundle (Phase 3 Task 1.4)
# scripts/bundle_python.py 复制 apps/api/.venv (~480 MiB) 到这里,
# 真实发布产物不出现在仓库中,INSTALL.md 仍然跟踪以让测试验证布局。
apps/desktop/src-tauri/binaries/python-bundle/
!apps/desktop/src-tauri/binaries/python-bundle/INSTALL.md
!apps/desktop/src-tauri/binaries/python-bundle/python

